<title>NETHERLANDS: Labouchere cuts Randstad to a Hold.</title>
<headline>Labouchere cuts Randstad to a Hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Feb research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Randstad	  temp labour   134.10  Bank Labouchere</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold (downgraded from Buy)</p>
<p>Preliminary 1996 results broadly in line with expectations. Stock downgraded to a Hold because lower net profit growth seen after 1997 and because of high valuation compared with international peers and other Dutch growth stocks. Earnings per share estimates for 1997 and 1998 lowered because of expected margin pressure.  </p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	3.78		  19.3    1.52</p>
<p>    1996		   4.75		  26.3    1.90</p>
<p>    1997		   5.55    (5.70)    24.1    2.22</p>
<p>    1998		   6.10    (6.75)    22.0    2.44</p>
